                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1836151d-de88-3244-b423-e1714df62a23",
                        "entry_id": "b329dc92-2095-3798-8f59-42a968e3e691",
                        "glosses": [
                            "не основывающийся на предубеждении, на заранее сложившемся мнении; объективный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7769f3d7-239e-468c-a318-6183551ea66f",
                                "sense_id": "1836151d-de88-3244-b423-e1714df62a23",
                                "text": "По свидетельству непредвзятых участников Тимирязевских чтений, присутствовавшие поняли, что открыта новая страница в науке о жизни растений, увидели раздвинувшиеся горизонты биологии ― с активным привлечением знаний из органической химии, биохимии, с рассмотрением физических основ жизнедеятельности растений"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "63b4f187-3ce8-409d-8d24-1a7c96ef4884",
                        "source_entry_id": "b329dc92-2095-3798-8f59-42a968e3e691",
                        "source_sense_id": "1836151d-de88-3244-b423-e1714df62a23",
                        "target_lang_word": "unprejudiced",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unprejudiced",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b765031a-1dc6-38d2-b90b-4bd628164a30",
                                        "entry_id": "82c02b23-56c6-3073-b1aa-b9eae071e479",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not prejudiced."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65d63c6f-5a22-4bd8-96b2-5a5fec519588",
                                                "sense_id": "b765031a-1dc6-38d2-b90b-4bd628164a30",
                                                "text": "On becoming a member of the College of Physicians, I made a tour of the principal cities of Europe, taking letters of introduction to eminent medical men; and gathering from many theories and modes of treatment, hints to enlarge the foundations of unprejudiced and comprehensive practice, I had resolved to fix my ultimate residence in London."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfb7731d-5d50-4d0f-9e78-4bd5b26c599b",
                                                "sense_id": "b765031a-1dc6-38d2-b90b-4bd628164a30",
                                                "text": "But when it comes to capacity on the road, no unprejudiced observer can deny that Mr. Bulleid produced in these engines two designs that are capable of almost anything, whether in speed or load haulage."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4a721212-8c3c-4d90-b5d1-7a5f22d00c98",
                        "source_entry_id": "b329dc92-2095-3798-8f59-42a968e3e691",
                        "source_sense_id": "1836151d-de88-3244-b423-e1714df62a23",
                        "target_lang_word": "impartial",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "impartial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dcabc6ca-5146-3e31-94f3-23ab244f7f81",
                                        "entry_id": "fb69591f-bc4d-3ce5-8516-96041ac96a0f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "treating all parties, rivals, or disputants equally; not partial; not biased"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64f38e14-1812-4fd9-9116-a48e3e804290",
                                                "sense_id": "dcabc6ca-5146-3e31-94f3-23ab244f7f81",
                                                "text": "[W]e are to take a ſecond ſurvievv of our Abilities, to ſee if they be confidently fit for that vvhereto our inclination ſvvayeth us: and if upon due impartial examination vve find they are, vve may then follovv the ſvvay of our inclinations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c161bf3c-0338-4724-a83a-af07197d0422",
                        "source_entry_id": "b329dc92-2095-3798-8f59-42a968e3e691",
                        "source_sense_id": "1836151d-de88-3244-b423-e1714df62a23",
                        "target_lang_word": "unbiassed",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
